# Playbook repo (maintainers)

This is the design-system monorepo, not a Playbook consumer app. Kit and shared changes must stay **performant** and **regression-safe** — many apps consume this package ([`readable-code.mdc`](readable-code.mdc)).

## Packages

- `playbook/` — kits (React + Rails), tokens, AI schema scripts
- `playbook-website/` — docs site, `config/menu.yml`, playground UI
- Repo root — `yarn generate:docs-metadata`, setup/run scripts

## Generated files (do not hand-edit)

Edit sources, then regenerate. Never patch these by hand:

- `**/kit.schema.json`
- `**/docs/_playground.json`
- `**/utilities/global-props.schema.json`
- `**/AvailableProps/globalPropsValues.ts`
- `playbook/dist/ai/**`

Playground authoring source: `**/docs/_playground.overrides.json`

## After relevant source changes

From repo root:

```bash
yarn generate:docs-metadata
```

Triggers for regenerate: kit `.tsx`/`.ts`/`.rb` props, `globalProps.ts`, `types/*.ts`, spacing/breakpoint tokens, `_playground.overrides.json`.

Pre-commit also regenerates and fails if generated output is dirty — stage the regenerated files and commit again.

## Docs map

- AI / `dist/ai`: `docs/AI_METADATA.md`
- Playground: `docs/PLAYGROUND_CONFIG.md`
- Global props: `docs/ADDING_GLOBAL_PROPS.md`
- Cross-agent entry: `AGENTS.md`
